WEBVTT

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:08.130
GDF Base on the Front Lines
"Undina" Air Space

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.420
<"The primitive beings!
Hunt them down to the last one!">

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:07.090
The UOA and EEU armies have evacuated!

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.090
We've lost contact with the Third Asteroid Unit.

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:09.000
Firewalls for Bases 1 through 3 have collapsed!

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.360
A Wulgaru ship is approaching
the transmission satellite!

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.700
Transmission satellite destroyed!

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:18.940
I can see that!

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:22.430
Lt. Smith, please head to the
Command Room immediately.

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:26.220
At this rate, Undina Base is doomed.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.350
The UPI Army should fall back like the others.

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:30.590
But if they break through...

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.320
We should protect Undina with our lives.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:34.780
As things currently stand,
we cannot defend the base!

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.490
Do you want everyone to die in vain?!

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:37.950
Calm down.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:41.910
Your decision please, Commander!

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:46.790
We will retreat. The UPI Army
will abandon Undina Base.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:49.360
Commence the evacuation plan immediately.

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:51.490
Please provide fresh soldiers!

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:53.750
I know. Simon!

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.620
Allow me to introduce you.

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:00.550
This is Commander Simon
from the secret service, MJP.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.140
MJP...?

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:08.980
Majestic Prince

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:12.390
"Sortie"

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.860
Commence mock battle!

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.870
I can handle this on my own.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:04.880
Huh? Asagi?

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:08.120
I'm going, too!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.370
Huh? Tamaki, wait!

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.750
Let's draw in closer before
we commence the operation!

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.030
You're too fast!

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.090
Tamaki!

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.650
Unit 1 has been shot down.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:35.480
Ditto for Unit 2.

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:37.190
And Unit 3...

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:38.610
Morons.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.830
I'm dyin' to shoot those punks down!

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:49.580
You have received the worst scores
yet again, Team Rabbits!

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.290
Just what I'd expect from the Fail Five!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.880
Don't get started!

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.700
It's true that we got the worst score.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.240
And you shouldn't have tried
to be a big shot and charged ahead.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:04.020
The thought of attacking as a team
had totally flown out of your head.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:08.540
You're not one to talk, you wannabe sniper!

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.780
How dare you load live ammo onto a practice unit!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:11.960
That's against the rules!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.260
Live ammo?

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:14.730
Even a newb could see that

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.810
they're practice shells based on their blue coat job.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:20.400
How could you be a student here
and not know that?

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:22.600
Kn-knock it off!

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.060
Just ignore them.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.200
But-!

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:28.830
Are you all right?

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:01.260
I'm sure you are aware,

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.980
but you have the lowest grades
yet again this semester.

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:07.980
None of you are by any means incompetent,

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:10.410
but you fall apart in team battles.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.330
You are fumbling over each other.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:13.120
Instructor!

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:14.830
What is it, Asagi?

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:18.540
Please change my team.
I cannot fight with these guys.

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:23.390
Submit a report analyzing the reasoning and basis

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:25.040
for why you cannot fight.

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.590
You have 30 minutes.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.050
That goes for everyone!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.210
You just had to say that!

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:34.890
You're dragging us down with you.

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.670
Don't take it out on me.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.900
We are the Fail Five...

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.020
Don't call us that.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:44.990
I've gotta run!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.420
I'm sorry, but I have a girlfriend.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.210
SALTED SQUID GUTS

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.790
I got turned down again.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.640
No kidding!

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:07.000
All he did was treat you kindly once.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.730
I felt fate!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.140
It's still way popular amongst gun enthusiasts.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:12.220
Its velvety texture is just like your skin!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.470
And this slide-

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.270
Be sure to put your tray up
when you finish eating.

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:20.930
Huh?

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:22.060
Hey, Suruga!

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.790
Hurry up on your report.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.780
And what are you drawing?

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.330
The theme is "Love and Justice".

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:34.970
I didn't ask.

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:38.340
What'll happen? I mean, if Undina falls?

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:39.530
Wouldn't that be pretty bad?

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:42.760
Do you think the enemy really looks like aliens?

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:45.330
Dunno. They haven't been able to
confirm even that much.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.300
We probably won't be sent hunting
for a good while yet.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.390
I wonder if my love will bear fruit first...?

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.470
Isn't your bosom the only thing growing?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:56.630
That's not true. I'm sure it'll work out...

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:57.140
...someday.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.540
When'll that be?! Is it soon or a long ways off?

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:00.980
Well, I can't say...

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.940
A lame attempt to comfort her
will have the opposite effect.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:04.940
Seriously.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:07.940
You totally don't get how a girl's heart works.

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:17.830
Instructor Suzukaze, Commander Simon
would like to see you.

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.330
I let myself in.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.130
Did you call for me?

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.920
We have received a sortie request from GDF.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:30.760
Is that...?

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:33.160
We are participating in the
Undina Evacuation Plan.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:34.460
Evacuation?!

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:37.040
Gather Team Rabbits together and have
them prepare to leave immediately.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.270
They aren't ready for this yet!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:40.230
Hurry.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.940
Yes, sir...

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:49.060
Team Rabbits, report to Gate 0131 ASAP.

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:51.840
Gate 0131? Doesn't that gate
lead to outer space?

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:55.100
Why? Are they gonna exile us?

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:55.990
They wouldn't!

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:56.950
Special training?

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:59.040
And here I was in the groove...

00:07:59.040 --> 00:07:59.910
Seriously?

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:08.710
Hurry on board.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.330
Thank you for the candy.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:35.950
Yes?

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.030
If possible, could I have that one?

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:39.320
Scumbag!

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.040
Pervert!

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.160
You gotta respect that.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.540
Respect what?

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.040
That was lost on me.

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:46.920
Izuru, you're also a pervert.

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:13.400
Awesome!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:24.280
Uh, there are five units...

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.650
I can see that!

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:26.580
Don't tell me...

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.710
Team Rabbits!

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:38.140
Team Rabbits will hereby depart for Undina.

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:42.710
Uh, isn't Undina currently
under Wulgaru attack...?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.550
You will be briefed about your mission
upon boarding Godinion.

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.560
Transport the AHSMB units into the Pit.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:50.600
I repeat: Transport the AHSMB into the Pit.

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:51.940
Sir, this would be our first time
piloting actual units...

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:55.140
Their basic commands are
the same as the practice units.

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:57.080
In fact, they should prove easier to pilot.

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.570
The JURIA-SYSTEM
has been uploaded into them.

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:01.810
Who's Juria again?

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.100
The system architect.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:09.420
By incorporating the pilot's DNA,
this system increases AHSMB's precision.

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:13.370
We have already uploaded your DNA data
into the JURIA-SYSTEM.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.530
Now then, I shall announce your formation.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.590
Gunner: Suruga.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.220
Control Unit: Kei.

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:22.930
Booster Unit: Tamaki.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.720
Forward Unit: Asagi.

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:27.980
And the leader... is Izuru Hitachi.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.180
You will be the leader in this operation.

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:33.980
The leader?

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:35.230
Our leader?

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:36.530
The leader...

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:37.400
For real?

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:44.920
This is Godinion.
Requesting permission for takeoff.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.750
This is control.
Godinion is cleared for takeoff.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:51.780
Cleared for takeoff. All ranges: Green.

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:52.830
Increasing backup engine output.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.070
Activating turbine activation sequence.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:11:00.340
External power has been established.
Disconnect all equipment.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:00.340
AUP activated.
All hatches closed.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:03.170
External pressure increasing. Turbines activated.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:04.680
Main engine military!

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.020
Take off!

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.820
I will explain the operation.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:24.060
Undina is the GDF's frontline base,
located at coordinates CR-34.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:26.360
It is currently under enemy attack.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:28.920
We are to evacuate and abandon this base.

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.450
The operation is simple.

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:35.510
You must buy time while the personnel
evacuate Undina Base.

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:36.510
That is all.

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:38.740
They will finish evacuating in three hours.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.760
We expect the base to fall in 2.5 hours.

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:43.290
All you have to do is throw the enemy into disarray and

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.550
upset their plans for thirty minutes.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.140
Okay?

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:47.450
Yes, ma'am!

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:53.220
Don't respond without thinking!

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:55.360
Do you realize how hard this is gonna be?

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.320
But we have to pull this off...

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:24.290
Why the sigh of relief?

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.850
Today, this is the first time
no one snapped at me.

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:29.590
This is our leader...?

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:30.220
Our leader...

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:31.710
Our leader?

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.440
That's what we want to nitpick over the most.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:35.090
That is all I have to say.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.090
Commander!

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:42.860
As you heard, Undina Base is in a dire situation.

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:47.140
But we can still change the tide of war if we swiftly evacuate

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.830
as many people as possible.

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:51.290
What are your dreams at present?

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:52.570
Our dreams?

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:53.360
That's right.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:56.820
My dream has already come true!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:59.040
It was my dream to fight piloting

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.510
a cutting-edge unit as a member of the GDF.

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:03.470
And you?

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:06.970
I-I guess that goes for me, too.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.720
I never put any thought into what my dream is.

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:12.180
M-my dweam ish...

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.220
Uh, well, I...

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.310
I want to become a hero!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:22.580
A hero?

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.710
What the heck?

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:26.160
What a moron...

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.620
Huh? Why's that?

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:29.580
Silence!

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:35.000
You are the GDF's dream.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.880
We shall hereby commence Operation Sarvar.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.430
Everyone, prepare for sortie!

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:49.610
The forward unit dogfights in the vanguard.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:51.970
It is a versatile midrange battle unit.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:55.390
It's set to prioritize bursts of
near-instant acceleration.

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.020
Go easy on the throttle.

00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:58.930
Okay!

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:03.930
The control unit uses a
wide-range battle alert system,

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.060
which will be your eyes and ears
on the battlefield.

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:07.700
A single order from your control unit

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.320
can determine whether your team lives or dies.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:10.900
You got that?

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:11.780
I certainly do.

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:15.030
Don't be shocked by the boosters' speed.

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:17.750
This puppy can fly faster than
a high-speed planetary cruiser.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.820
Make sure to never stop.

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:21.530
Constantly move as you
throw the enemy into confusion.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:29.870
The gunner uses...

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:33.040
Long-ranged attacks with a
high-energy charged particle cannon

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:35.550
and radiation-guided photon resonance
antiaircraft artillery, right?

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.390
At least you're knowledgeable.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:40.550
After a full-power volley, the time lag

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:43.150
and acceleration will be a beat off, so watch yourself.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:45.220
Your unit is meant for the leader.

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:47.390
Like the forward unit, it is versatile.

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:50.020
But it is capable of handling even
higher-level command transmissions.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:52.520
Keep constant tab on all incoming information on each unit

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:54.050
and issue the appropriate commands.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.080
Are you done with the explanations?

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:58.030
Yes, Boss!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.180
Bunnies, hang in there!

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:03.170
We will be deploying in the Pit.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.400
Let us know if you need any weapons.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.780
We'll send them over.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.680
Also let us know if you need any
emergency maintenance.

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:14.510
You see, AHSMB break easily in exchange
for their high-energy output.

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:15.430
What?!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:18.140
Don't worry! We've got your backs.

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.390
Prepare for battle.

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:25.630
Godinion, enter Combat Formation I.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:28.210
Main control: Move CIC.

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:32.770
Navi bridge: Closed.

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:34.060
Bulkhead: Locked.

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:36.520
Whole control room: Move complete.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:37.450
Completed.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:50.420
What was that just now?

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:52.290
You connected with your AHSMB.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:53.960
We connected...?

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:56.110
You are linked together with your AHSMB.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.630
That activates the JURIA-SYSTEM.

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:00.350
Ready for standby?

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:02.830
All vessels enter detachment mode.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:05.020
Detachment mode: Ready.

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:06.530
Open the bolts.

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:08.860
Pits, take off!

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:10.600
Ignite thrusters.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.150
All vessels are ready.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.780
All vessels, activate thrusters.

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.820
All Pit vessels have reached
their designated positions.

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:25.530
Verification checks are complete.
Output is increasing normally.

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.620
Blast off!

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:05.740
All AHSMB units have taken off.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:15.790
<"Don't let them escape! Crush them all!">

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.750
At this rate, they'll kill everyone!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.610
Flying aircrafts not in the codebook
are approaching from behind.

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:25.600
No, this is a GDF code...

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:26.560
The MJP?

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:28.680
It's them?

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:36.780
Wow, we've come to quite the hot spot.

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:39.460
Think we'll make it back alive?

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:43.340
I am John Smith, Operations Commander
at GDF Headquarters.

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:45.690
I am Lt. Commander Suzukaze of the MJP.

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:47.870
Lt. Commander Suzukaze, please have

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:50.960
units 1-5 commence battle at Secret Code Delta Zulu-41.

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:55.020
Roger. Commence battle at Delta Zulu-41.

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.930
All AHSMB units have turned
on the emergency brakes.

00:17:57.710 --> 00:18:00.420
What are you doing?! Get into your positions!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.420
What?! Now it's moving on its own!

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:01.890
AHSMB has a mind of its own!

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:04.850
Your survival instinct is moving it.

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:07.050
Unless you decide to fight,

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:09.360
the JURIA-SYSTEM's
defensive instincts will remain active.

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:10.640
Defensive instincts...?

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.230
You have no choice but to fight!

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:15.840
She's right.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.820
If we don't fight, we'll die!

00:18:18.390 --> 00:18:19.780
We'll die!

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:28.170
The AHSMB units have reached their positions.

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:30.350
The enemy is split into three waves.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:32.880
First attack the one in the 2 o'clock direction.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:33.750
Roger!

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:38.590
What's with this acceleration?!
It's too sensitive!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.900
Rose 3, activate your shield.

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:53.360
Red 5, Blue 1, activate your shields!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:16.460
Hurry! Retreat while they're buying us some time!

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.530
Rose 3, launch your missiles.

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.280
Roger!

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:46.230
Undina Base's Third Mobile Infantry Regiment

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:49.870
and the Outer Planetary Army's
21st Regiment have finished evacuating.

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:54.880
The evacuation is complete.
Return promptly!

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:03.260
People are still down there?

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.050
Allow me to confirm.

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:09.130
You're right...

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:11.690
This is Purple 2. Godinion, please respond.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:16.570
GDF Headquarters, there are still people
in the Civilian Residential District.

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:18.350
It's too late.

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.180
But-!

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:20.390
Please pull back.

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:22.030
There aren't any ships left for them!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:30.790
Units 1-5, return.

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:34.150
Izuru?

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:34.970
What's keeping you?

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:36.230
She said to go back...

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:37.710
What're you doing?

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.790
People are still down there.
And there are so many...

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:43.410
There aren't any ships left for them.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.290
Come back.

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:48.640
Wasn't it our mission to make sure
that everyone escaped?

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:48.640
Several enemy ships are approaching.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.870
If there aren't any vessels,

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:52.330
the only way to save those

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.400
people is to defeat all of the enemy ships here.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.000
Could we pull that off?

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:56.610
It's impossible!

00:20:57.010 --> 00:21:00.320
You can't become a hero
if you don't do the impossible!

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:01.780
That's so not you.

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:04.240
That doesn't match you.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.200
Why're you actin' so fired up?

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.160
Were you serious about becoming a hero?

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:09.510
They're coming.

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:12.120
Thanks to you, we're stuck fighting!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.740
Why aren't you retreating?

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:16.210
Do you seriously intend to face
the enemy's main fleet head on?

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.090
They have no choice but to fight now...

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:19.870
How can we win this...?

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:21.550
We really should be running.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.790
Run away? Fight!

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:27.510
Run away. Fight!

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:29.470
Run away...

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:33.840
Fight!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:40.970
<"Destroy that red one!">

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.030
Red 5, you're over-exerting it!

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:46.490
Izuru, to your right!

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:51.080
Why'd it move on its own?!

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:53.160
HEP Cannon: Set.

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:56.110
Fire at maximum power!

00:22:28.520 --> 00:22:30.150
Red 5 is fully storming the enemy.

00:22:30.940 --> 00:22:32.310
<"Lord Rada, we won't be able to escape if we stay">

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:34.980
<"Enough! I grow weary of this battle. This hunt is over">

00:22:47.410 --> 00:22:49.500
The enemy fleet has retreated.

00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:51.460
Confirming that all AHSMB units are intact.

00:22:52.840 --> 00:22:54.020
The enemy fleet is pulling away from Undina.

00:22:54.020 --> 00:22:55.930
They are headed toward Jupiter.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.900
They protected a base
that we were going to abandon?

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:07.280
We did it...

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:56.040
"Heroes are Born"
